==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Grand Battle}}

==Battleground==
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*2 [[Commander Ostromeda]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Calamary]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Raynard]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Great Angel Chibinel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*30 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is intended to be an ubercarry Colosseum, so if you have any strong [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]], don't be afraid to use them!

If you're a no-Uber player (or just don't have many great Ubers), this stage can be fairly difficult due to the presence of multiple Ostromedas and insanely strong Shy Boys. The best idea is to use Talented [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to destroy the 1st Sir Seal (and if possible, the 1st Shy Boy as well) to get a boost of cash before Ostromeda comes out. [[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]] is a good option to tank, though you might wanna use [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Fried Chicken Cat]] as well to disable Ostromeda's Warp, and then kill them with any good anti-Alien/generalist DPS that outranges, such as [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]. Even with Soap Cat, you'll want a few cheap meatshields to fill in the gaps, and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to deal with the J.J. Jackrabbits.

You don't want to push too close to Raynard, since his DPS is deceptively high, especially with Surge Attacks factored in.

